{
  "text": "紫微斗數全書",
  "juan": "卷一",
  "section": "雜局",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L001",
      "original_quote": "風雲際會：身命雖弱二限逢祿馬是也。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L002",
      "original_quote": "錦上添花：謂限破惡星而行吉地是也。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L003",
      "original_quote": "祿衰馬困：限逢七殺祿馬空亡是也。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L004",
      "original_quote": "衣錦還鄉：少年不遂四十後行墓運是也。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L005",
      "original_quote": "步數無依：前限接後限連綿不分是也。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L006",
      "original_quote": "水上駕星：一年好一年不好是也。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L007",
      "original_quote": "吉凶相伴：命有主星限前則發限衰不發是也。",
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Zaju_L008",
      "original_quote": "枯木逢春：謂命衰限好是也。",
      "tag": []
    }
  ],
  "_extraction_status": "定雜局完成"
}